  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "2ce60fada24ae005",
      "translationZh": "通过“AI for Math Initiative”加速发现",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0439d88058d9bfcc",
      "translationZh": "该计划汇聚了世界上一些最负盛名的研究机构，旨在开创将 AI 应用于数学研究的先河。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "301db8e05fb36c94",
      "translationZh": "Google DeepMind 科学与战略计划副总裁",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "117fa19a966b53c8",
      "translationZh": "Google DeepMind 生成式 AI 战略高级总监",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d35caae85cece2b6",
      "translationZh": "Google DeepMind 和 Google 正在启动“AI for Math Initiative”，探索 AI 如何加速数学研究。五家享有盛誉的研究机构将与 Google DeepMind 合作。它们将确定可借助 AI 获得洞见的数学问题，并利用 Google DeepMind 的技术构建工具，推动研究进展。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6b43a10482221e5d",
      "translationZh": "摘要由 Google AI 生成。生成式 AI 尚处于实验阶段。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "f78709718eb786a2",
      "translationZh": "“AI for Math Initiative”利用 AI 帮助数学家更快地取得发现。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "394b6e74084672e3",
      "translationZh": "Google DeepMind 和 Google 正通过资金和 AI 技术为该计划提供支持。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "7d58f7bae955da87",
      "translationZh": "五家顶尖研究机构将探索如何利用 AI 解决数学难题。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "7030b56c850e5879",
      "translationZh": "Gemini Deep Think 和 AlphaEvolve 等 AI 系统已经展现出潜力。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "a5eaf4b4669dc3c8",
      "translationZh": "AI 专家与数学专家携手合作，有望带来重大的科学突破。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e66bfb52f5a58c1f",
      "translationZh": "Google 希望利用计算机帮助聪明的人解决非常困难的数学问题。他们正在向大学提供资金和工具，让大家能够共同合作。计算机可以找到新的数学方法，并更快地解决问题。Google 希望这能帮助每个人了解世界的新知识。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "f344ef9188695765",
      "translationZh": "探索其他风格：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3efa044e3b122c2b",
      "translationZh": "数学是宇宙的基础语言，提供了描述万事万物的工具，从物理定律到生物学的复杂细节，再到计算机科学的逻辑，皆在其中。几个世纪以来，数学的前沿一直仅靠人类的智慧来拓展。在 Google DeepMind，我们相信 AI 可以成为与数学家协作的强大工具，增强创造力并加速发现。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "071bbe344a24ef20",
      "translationZh": "今天，我们推出由 Google DeepMind 和 Google.org 支持的 AI for Math Initiative。该计划汇聚了全球五家最负盛名的研究机构，率先探索在数学研究中运用 AI。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4b8f128fae54faf4",
      "translationZh": "首批合作机构包括：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "08574431c00d5a83",
      "translationZh": "伦敦帝国理工学院",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0018",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "fb370b46b1272950",
      "translationZh": "普林斯顿高等研究院",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0019",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "7b83ca1d27ce7772",
      "translationZh": "法国高等科学研究所（IHES）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0020",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "55cdca298fbe8a6b",
      "translationZh": "西蒙斯计算理论研究所（加州大学伯克利分校）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0021",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "f6ddbfb7e21b97ed",
      "translationZh": "塔塔基础研究院（TIFR）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0022",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8ff476c2e9b5d265",
      "translationZh": "该倡议的合作伙伴将为共同目标携手努力：确定下一代适合借助 AI 驱动的洞见取得突破的数学问题，构建推动这些进展的基础设施和工具，并最终加快发现的步伐。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0023",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "461e3299941cf2dc",
      "translationZh": "Google 的支持包括来自 Google.org 的资金，以及使用 Google DeepMind 最先进技术的机会，例如名为 Gemini Deep Think 的增强推理模式、我们的算法发现智能体 AlphaEvolve，以及我们的形式化证明补全系统 AlphaProof。该倡议将在基础研究与 AI 应用之间建立强大的反馈循环，为更深入的合作打开大门。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0024",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "546d78bbe1d5cc0a",
      "translationZh": "AI 与数学的关键时刻",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0025",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e23e1965a6529805",
      "translationZh": "AI for Math Initiative 推出之际，AI 的推理能力正取得显著进展；我们自己的工作在近几个月也取得了快速进展。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0026",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "604d8442cf9b3b04",
      "translationZh": "2024 年，我们的 AlphaGeometry 和 AlphaProof 系统在国际数学奥林匹克竞赛（IMO）中达到了银牌水平。最近，我们配备 Deep Think 的最新 Gemini 模型在今年的 IMO 中达到了金牌水平，完整解出了六道题中的五道，获得 35 分。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0027",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "dca73f5b57b91a8a",
      "translationZh": "我们的另一种方法 AlphaEvolve 也取得了进一步进展：它被应用于数学分析、几何、组合数学和数论领域的 50 多个开放问题，并在其中 20% 的问题上改进了此前已知的最佳解法。在数学与算法发现方面，它发明了一种效率更高的矩阵乘法新方法——矩阵乘法是计算中的一项核心运算。针对 4x4 矩阵相乘这一具体问题，AlphaEvolve 发现了一种仅需 48 次标量乘法的算法，打破了 Strassen’s algorithm 于 1969 年创下、保持了 50 年的纪录。在计算机科学领域，它帮助研究人员发现了新的数学结构，表明某些复杂问题对计算机而言，比我们此前所知的还要难以求解。这让我们对计算极限有了更清晰、更精确的认识，有助于指导未来的研究。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0028",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "86fd0364ed2f1871",
      "translationZh": "这些快速进展证明了 AI 模型能力的迅速发展。我们希望这项新倡议能够探索 AI 如何加速数学研究中的发现，并攻克更难的问题。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0029",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "22f1e91fdbd8a000",
      "translationZh": "对于 AI 能做的一切，以及它如何帮助我们思考科学中最深刻的问题，我们的理解才刚刚起步。我们相信，将世界顶尖数学家深刻的直觉与 AI 的新颖能力相结合，可以开辟新的研究路径，推动人类知识进步，并迈向各科学学科的新突破。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0030",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "fefef2f9c6cb957b",
      "translationZh": "我们在 2026 年 9 月公布的最新 AI 消息",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0031",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "3f3f85b44128dca7",
      "translationZh": "支持高等教育做好 AI 应用准备",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0032",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "91979947e61b341b",
      "translationZh": "作者：Google 新闻团队",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0033",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "0427f9d1d93e63e6",
      "translationZh": "我们正在推出 SynthID Bio，将我们的水印技术引入合成生物学领域。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0034",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "f8c82da6e06216fb",
      "translationZh": "帮助 25,000 名退伍军人及军人家属在技术工种领域发展职业生涯",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0035",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "580bc2cb906ff774",
      "translationZh": "Google 与盖茨基金会将为全球南方的 2 亿农民提供 AI 资源。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0036",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3230a6fce18f75cc",
      "translationZh": "小农经营着超过 5 亿个农场，生产了全球近 35% 的粮食，但他们往往无法获取卫星数据、金融服务以及……",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0037",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "5e6afea02697dff1",
      "translationZh": "利用 AI 帮助地方政府与民众建立联系",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0038",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2b610e4d9f1b8877",
      "translationZh": "作者：Omar Medina 和 Yasmin Green",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    }
  ],
